{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c3ee6b490a69fc2c3960fd0801a683ebae2cfcf20b9b698bc89c844c90206e",
      "text": "呼……总算结束了试镜。\n果然，对雨彦的反应很不错呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8f85c289f823ee6702803489a9dd0a070b1d28b034d962d354d7038d7536c8",
      "text": "……怎么了，北村。\n一脸无精打采的样子，是在担心结果吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2faebc282e4184e5f32c3da05d9119a573eb93cc4b36e5aeae2418272413a98",
      "text": "所忧之事，何止一端。……虽然结果也\n很让人挂心，但我总觉得这样真的好吗～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f80ac469f1e118f1c5e57b3ed95aaa6d6b34a4c31b8d6cff02784bdc8a40faa",
      "text": "“传达出组合的魅力和自己的风格很\n重要”，制作人之前是这么说的吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a15a7e4e92b5b0acd0e5303d21a6f4f08d30513f4d7d50485adba97f05c547",
      "text": "确实，雨彦先生的魅力我觉得传达到了……\n但反过来说，也仅限于此了吧～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21ed84f20b717235eff1e9cb1b791523b849c63ae019f4a377785bb551a34d44",
      "text": "说实话，我觉得并没有传达出作为组合的魅力，\n感觉……并没有非要录用我们3个人的理由呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a5d30a52173eb7610fd02c1fb0a5d628cba6951388498cee897089e07fd3a2b",
      "text": "抱歉啊，把你留下来。\n那么，关于试镜的感想……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5503cc65a0c78b6c4d6ac1cfdf9a4dc8535e9a9be7afe76afde7dab83870a48f",
      "text": "葛之叶君，他很出色！\n清扫技巧似乎也无可挑剔。……但是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a73d8a589f1d646740e32d3deb4ee96192434b3285f5db25abef258929f623c2",
      "text": "北村想乐先生，古论克里斯先生。\n这两个人的详情也很令人在意对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf7dbcc94ef5f79eb421f53ecbaefa71b74798211262fe599c9ff664e8e9e15c",
      "text": "就是说啊！我这个节目的观众，\n可不仅仅是看清扫技巧……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:446b378e19325ddef8c7d3ec7d9c0b0e107c4d23751a6c800617d85c09452d97",
      "text": "对出演偶像的人品性格，\n也是很有兴趣的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52ad325bc7b7844850b0ed500ce72817868113ea632f1e889994b5a904e38895",
      "text": "所以，希望你能再多跟我讲讲。\n他们是怎样的人，这又是怎样一个组合！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
